criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

1. adults 18 years and older;
2. able to complete verbal survey in English, Spanish, or Mandarin/Cantonese Chinese;
3. reside in Chicago;
4. able to give informed consent;
5. agree to a verbal consent document prior to being registered in the study;
6. has a smart device with access to the internet.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Age \<18
* Incarceration
* Adults unable to give informed consent
